  "reference": {
    "FirstArgmax": "p := 0;\nvar i := 1;\nwhile i < |s|\n  invariant 1 <= i <= |s|\n  invariant 0 <= p < i\n  invariant forall k :: 0 <= k < i ==> s[k] <= s[p]\n  invariant forall k :: 0 <= k < p ==> s[k] < s[p]\n  decreases |s| - i\n{\n  if s[i] > s[p] {\n    p := i;\n  }\n  i := i + 1;\n}"
